35,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, the board minutes are grim. A joint clinic collapsed in a year because neither department owned the rota. We must avoid shared arrangements that lack clear accountability.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Midori, that aligns with my findings. Readmissions fell only while the call-back trial ran, then drifted back. We must choose a program with clear, sustained ownership to prevent this quiet failure.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, that shared failure mirrors my staffing data. Nine ward posts are empty, and agency costs are rising. We cannot add load to exhausted teams.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, the ledger confirms my suspicion. The allocation is down a quarter, and fitting out is now charged to it. We are building on a shrinking foundation.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, that shrinking budget worries me. My booking data shows unlogged work vanishes, and our car park fills by eleven. We must choose a program that fits the existing flow, not one that breaks it.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, your point about unlogged work is vital. My data agreements took fourteen months to sign. We cannot rely on outside partners who are slow to commit.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, I agree. My staffing review shows physiotherapists leaving, but midwifery has unusual slack. We should leverage that existing capacity rather than adding new burdens to exhausted teams.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, the midwifery slack is a rare asset. But nine empty ward posts mean any new load lands on agency staff. We must protect that existing capacity.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
